# --- Pipeline outputs (NOT in this repo — archived on Zenodo) -----------------
# Every stage writes to an out/ dir; the harmonized stores, the 1,808-pathway
# ssGSEA matrix and the 2,132-table enrichment atlas total ~1.2 GB and live in
# the Zenodo deposit instead. Keep them out of the repo and off GitHub Pages.
code/*/out/
code/*/_work/
code/**/checkpoints/
code/**/sig_checkpoints/
*.parquet

